    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Late-afternoon fatigue, managed with pacing; no fever or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No blurred vision or pain on moving the eyes</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing change</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowels regular</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urgency or burning since June</td></tr><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lump</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Some neck and shoulder stiffness after long practice</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rash or changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Faint tingling in the left fingertips after long practice; no weakness or imbalance</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-9 3; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
