<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 15 minutes, with her consent. She named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here. She said that she wants to be told plainly about her illness and its treatment, that she wants every treatment that can keep her playing and independent, and that if she were ever too ill to decide she would want her wishes about music and comfort respected. To be revisited at each change in her health and at least yearly. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
